{"text":"Hopefully this would be a bit of a teaser. Let's get the most obvious reason why aid is not working in Africa out of the way, which is corruption. I think if you went outside right now to Brussels, Midi, and asked people why they think aid doesn't work, most people would say, oh, corruption. I'm not gonna spend a lot of time on this because I think it's very clear. The fact that there's money going into these countries that has no requirement for certain behavior means that we know it's often stolen and diverted and used for other projects. Some of my critics have said, oh, you know, that's an old story. Well, I'm afraid to tell you no, it's not. My own former president embroiled in a scandal of stealing money as we speak. Same next door in Malawi. The president there has got a lot of problems as having stolen allegedly $12 million that was earmarked for HIV AIDS. The story goes on and on. Look at Transparency International rankings. There's a reason why African countries are consistently at the bottom. Money is getting stolen.","words":[{"text":"Hopefully","start":0.0,"end":0.64},{"text":"this","start":0.64,"end":0.96},{"text":"would","start":0.96,"end":1.08},{"text":"be","start":1.08,"end":1.2},{"text":"a","start":1.2,"end":1.26},{"text":"bit","start":1.26,"end":1.34},{"text":"of","start":1.34,"end":1.48},{"text":"a","start":1.48,"end":1.58},{"text":"teaser","start":1.58,"end":1.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"Let's","start":2.28,"end":2.44},{"text":"get","start":2.44,"end":2.58},{"text":"the","start":2.58,"end":2.72},{"text":"most","start":2.72,"end":2.86},{"text":"obvious","start":2.86,"end":3.28},{"text":"reason","start":3.28,"end":3.68},{"text":"why","start":3.68,"end":4.0},{"text":"aid","start":4.0,"end":4.24},{"text":"is","start":4.24,"end":4.38},{"text":"not","start":4.38,"end":4.52},{"text":"working","start":4.52,"end":4.76},{"text":"in","start":4.76,"end":4.94},{"text":"Africa","start":4.94,"end":5.22},{"text":"out","start":5.22,"end":5.44},{"text":"of"